# 26_alpha_breath_RGB.ledc — Alpha + Breath (coherence), RGB inner/outer build
# RGB variant of 26_alpha_breath. Audio + speech IDENTICAL (10 Hz alpha + 0.1 Hz breath).
# LEDs on inner ring (mask 9, teal 0,150,160) + outer ring (mask 6, cool cyan 32,220,255),
# 180 antiphase, SINE gate, with the 0.1 Hz breathing LFO on brightness — the rings swell
# together like a slow breath. Every rate <=12 Hz; brightness <=40%. See base header.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask [env phase]

# --- Induction: 10 Hz alpha, vol + light fade in ---
0 10 50 >0 0 150 160 9 1 0       # inner teal: 10 Hz sine, fade-in
0 10 50 >0 32 220 255 6 1 180    # outer cyan: antiphase
A 0 240 0 >0 0 1 250 0            # ch1 binaural carrier 240 / R250 = 10 Hz beat; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 65 "Beginning at ten hertz, in alpha. Let your breath find a slow, easy rhythm."
15000 10 50 25 0 150 160 9 1 0   # inner: 25% reached
15000 10 50 25 32 220 255 6 1 180 # outer

# --- Alpha hold with 0.1 Hz breath (brightness swells 15<->35% every 10 s) ---
30000 10 50 ~15:35:10000 0 150 160 9 1 0   # inner: breathing (6 breaths/min coherence)
30000 10 50 ~15:35:10000 32 220 255 6 1 180 # outer
A 45000 240 0 100 0 1 250 0         # ch1 vol settled, beat 10 Hz
S 300000 default 65 "Ride the light as it breathes. In as it brightens, out as it softens."
S 660000 default 65 "Calm and open, resting in the alpha rhythm."

# --- Alert lift: ramp 10->12 Hz and brighten ---
780000 >10 50 >20 0 150 160 9 1 0    # inner: freq 10->12; bright ramp (preempts LFO)
780000 >10 50 >20 32 220 255 6 1 180 # outer
A 780000 >240 0 100 0 1 250 0       # carrier 240->238 => beat 10->12
S 780000 default 65 "Gently rising now, brightening, becoming alert and clear."
900000 12 50 >40 60 190 210 9 1 0    # inner: 12 Hz, brighter cool; bright 40 then fades
900000 12 50 >40 60 190 210 6 1 180  # outer

# --- Gentle close: brightness + volume fade to 0 over 30 s ---
A 900000 238 0 >100 0 1 250 0       # beat 12 Hz held; vol 50->0
930000 12 50 0 60 190 210 9 1 0      # inner off
930000 12 50 0 60 190 210 6 1 180    # outer off
A 930000 238 0 0 0 1 250 0          # volume 0
